data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (injective-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (tangent-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (immersion graph relative to explicit differential and tangent-space families, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}immersion} \\vdash \\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(f,M,N,D,T_M,T_N) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(D,M,\\operatorname{ran}(D))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T_M,M,\\operatorname{ran}(T_M))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T_N,N,\\operatorname{ran}(T_N))\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_M(p),M,p)\\land\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_N(f(p)),N,f(p))\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(D(p),T_M(p),T_N(f(p)))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}immersion} \\vdash \\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(f,M,N,D,T_M,T_N) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(D,M,\\operatorname{ran}(D))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T_M,M,\\operatorname{ran}(T_M))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T_N,N,\\operatorname{ran}(T_N))\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_M(p),M,p)\\land\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_N(f(p)),N,f(p))\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(D(p),T_M(p),T_N(f(p)))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Immersions have injective differential at every point.  The current knowledge base has no manifold-differential graph atom, so the differential family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> is an explicit input rather than an undefined symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"df_p\">\\(df_p\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headi